The minimum hypotheses agree. In the live Lean definitions, `ReaderLaws` quantifies over **all unary lengths**, and `MinimumReader` minimizes over all such readers with exactly one source `j`. The weaker probe predicate `SelfintClass.Reader` is used for refutations: `¬ Reader R` also excludes a full-law reader. Passing probes is never promoted to full reader laws.

